WEBVTT

00:06:27.386 --> 00:06:30.244
to be threatening the evaporation

00:06:30.268 --> 00:06:32.799
of millions of people
on the other side of the Earth.

00:06:34.267 --> 00:06:37.379
Surely we can do better for ourselves,

00:06:37.403 --> 00:06:40.967
drawing on our ingenuity
to solve complex problems,

00:06:40.991 --> 00:06:43.008
as we have in the past.

00:06:43.032 --> 00:06:45.705
After all, this is a man-made,

00:06:45.729 --> 00:06:46.950
human-made --

00:06:46.974 --> 00:06:49.497
I shouldn't say "man,"
because women were involved --

00:06:49.521 --> 00:06:51.157
a human-made problem.

00:06:52.669 --> 00:06:55.657
We have human solutions
that should be possible.

00:06:57.238 --> 00:07:01.038
So, next question: "Who do you think
should make nuclear decisions?"